        "template": "trix-two-text-two",
        "data": {},
        "extras": {
            "title_1": {
                "en": "MISSION"
            },
            "title_2": {
                "en": "Volunteer today!"
            },
            "content_1": {
                "en": "<b>Vivid Faith</b>"
            },
            "content_2": {
                "en": "Serving others is one of the most fulfilling and life-changing experiences you can live.<br><br>That is why we partner with <a href='https://vividfaith.com'>Vivid Faith</a> to provide you with opportunities to help others in the context of mission all over the world. You can help in various areas, such as but not limited to: evangelism, medicine and health, education, and administration.<br><br>If you are between 18 and 35 years old, and live in a country that is part of the Inter-European Division, the Youth Ministries Department also offers financial support and guidance for each service opportunity. Contact us to learn more."
            }
        }
    },
